PX4-Autopilot license, retained verbatim
========================================

SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause

The Modelica sources in this directory are a statement-for-statement
transcription of PX4-Autopilot's `src/modules/ekf2/EKF` module and of the
supporting `src/lib/matrix` rotation primitives, read at PX4-Autopilot commit

    bd62df5e3ac3f3f4a07da4518062a922492adb6c
    https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot

That upstream is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License, whose first
condition requires that a redistribution of source code

    "retain the above copyright notice, this list of conditions and the
     following disclaimer."

This file discharges that obligation for `Ekf2/`: the upstream copyright
notice, the full list of conditions, and the disclaimer are reproduced below
verbatim, not paraphrased. Nothing in this file is a grant by the CogniPilot
Foundation; it is PX4's own text, retained.

The rest of this repository is licensed under Apache-2.0 (see the root
`LICENSE`). `Ekf2/` is the sole exception and is BSD-3-Clause. The two are
compatible; a consumer of `Ekf2/` must satisfy the conditions below.


