their own and are covered by the repository license in section 1:

    src/modules/ekf2/EKF/python/ekf_derivation/generated/predict_covariance.h
        SymForce autogeneration banner only; the symbolic derivation it was
        generated from is derivation.py, whose notice is listed above.
    src/lib/matrix/matrix/{Quaternion,Dcm,Vector}.hpp
        @file documentation banner only.


3. Transcription manifest
-------------------------

Which file here transcribes which file there. Each Modelica source repeats its
own citation in a header comment.

    axisAngleToQuat.mo          src/lib/matrix/matrix/Quaternion.hpp
    quatMultiply.mo             src/lib/matrix/matrix/Quaternion.hpp
    quatNormalize.mo            src/lib/matrix/matrix/Vector.hpp
    quatToRotationMatrix.mo     src/lib/matrix/matrix/Dcm.hpp
    predictState.mo             src/modules/ekf2/EKF/ekf.cpp
    predictStep.mo              src/modules/ekf2/EKF/ekf.cpp
    predictCovarianceStep.mo    src/modules/ekf2/EKF/covariance.cpp
    constrainStateVariances.mo  src/modules/ekf2/EKF/covariance.cpp
    fuseDirectStateMeasurement.mo
                                src/modules/ekf2/EKF/ekf_helper.cpp
    gpsHorizontalPositionFuse.mo
                                src/modules/ekf2/EKF/aid_sources/gnss/gps_control.cpp
                                src/modules/ekf2/EKF/position_fusion.cpp
                                src/modules/ekf2/EKF/ekf.h
    PredictCovariance.mo        src/modules/ekf2/EKF/python/ekf_derivation/
                                    generated/predict_covariance.h
                                (autogenerated by SymForce from
                                 python/ekf_derivation/derivation.py)
    DifferentialStep.mo         parameter defaults from
                                src/modules/ekf2/EKF/common.h; all math is in
                                the functions above


4. Endorsement
--------------

Condition 3 above forbids using the PX4 name to endorse or promote products
derived from PX4 software without prior written permission. No such
endorsement is claimed. `Ekf2/` names PX4 only to identify the upstream it
transcribes.
